mcp-server-zabbix (2.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rename source/binary package from zabbix-mcp-server to
    mcp-server-zabbix, matching the mcp-server-<name> convention, with
    a new mcprack-mcp-server-zabbix companion package.
  * Remove stale generated build output (debian/zabbix-mcp-server/ and
    friends) that had been accidentally committed to git with a broken
    /usr/bin/zabbix-mcp launcher (importing from a nonexistent 'src.
    zabbix_mcp_server' path); a clean rebuild produces the correct
    launcher matching the package's actual entry_points.txt.

 -- vitex <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Thu, 27 Aug 2026 14:30:00 +0200

zabbix-mcp-server (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package release
  * Comprehensive MCP server for Zabbix integration
  * Support for host, item, trigger, template, and user management
  * Support for problem, event, and maintenance management
  * Read-only mode support for secure monitoring
  * Support for both STDIO and HTTP transports

